WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.785 --> 00:00:04.130
The Light of Mafasca on the Path

2
00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:10.365
Long ago, two goatherds called Guise and
Ayose were returning with their goats

3
00:00:10.365 --> 00:00:12.550
along a path on Fuerteventura.

4
00:00:13.305 --> 00:00:17.470
The night was cold, and the wind blew out
every spark.

5
00:00:18.165 --> 00:00:22.750
Beside the path, they found an old wooden
cross.

6
00:00:23.245 --> 00:00:28.430
Without thinking, they broke off a piece
and used it to light a fire.

7
00:00:29.065 --> 00:00:32.290
They warmed the gofio and prepared to
carry on.

8
00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:36.530
Then a pale light came out of the flames.

9
00:00:37.345 --> 00:00:41.970
It was not large, but it floated above the
stones.

10
00:00:42.665 --> 00:00:49.025
The goatherds remembered the tales of
Mafasca and said: “Light of Mafasca, I

11
00:00:49.025 --> 00:00:52.745
won’t follow you: I’m going back along the
path.”

12
00:00:52.745 --> 00:00:54.210
They walked quickly.

13
00:00:54.765 --> 00:00:56.150
The light followed them.

14
00:00:56.545 --> 00:00:59.290
They stopped, and the light stopped too.

15
00:00:59.765 --> 00:01:05.525
Guise and Ayose realised that they had
used a cross without respecting what it

16
00:01:05.525 --> 00:01:06.525
meant.

17
00:01:06.605 --> 00:01:12.585
They promised to return at dawn, repair
the cross and never break off any more

18
00:01:12.585 --> 00:01:13.910
wood from that place.

19
00:01:14.685 --> 00:01:19.170
At that moment, the light grew smaller
until it disappeared.

20
00:01:20.605 --> 00:01:23.430
The next day, they kept their promise.

21
00:01:24.005 --> 00:01:30.765
Afterwards, they told the story to other
goatherds so that no one would do the same

22
00:01:30.765 --> 00:01:31.765
thing.

23
00:01:31.805 --> 00:01:37.145
From then on, whenever a light flickered
in the night, they remembered: “Light of

24
00:01:37.145 --> 00:01:42.150
Mafasca, I won’t follow you: I’m going
back along the path.”

